<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2518_9709.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><persName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Leopold</persName>. Ertzhertzog zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-91" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Österreich</placeName> etc.
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ersame</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weise</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">besunnders</unclear> liebe. Wir haben uß
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">euweren</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beÿ</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jüngstlicher</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">versamblung</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-148" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Baden</placeName>,
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gewesten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">rats</unclear>: unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sanndtpotten</unclear>, den <date resp="#ner">24.ten
<lb n="5"/>octobris</date>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abgangenem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wideranntwortlichen</unclear> schreiben,
<lb n="6"/>euwer <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">treüwes</unclear> piten, die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vertröste</unclear> befünderung
<lb n="7"/>zur <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abfuorung</unclear>, inn der <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Marggrafßchafft</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ligenden</unclear>
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kriegsvolcks</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werckh</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ze</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">setzen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sambt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüw=</unclear>
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erpieten</unclear>, die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Erbeinigung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">treülich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ze</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">halt=</unclear>
<lb n="10"/>en, unnd zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">continuieren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vernommen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soellen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dargeg=</unclear>
<lb n="11"/>en <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">versicheren</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> wir an <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vollziechung</unclear>
<lb n="12"/>dessen, so wir eüch sowoll schriftlich, als <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">durch</unclear>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abgeordnete</unclear> sincerieren lassen, nichts ermang=
<lb n="14"/>let, sonndern alle <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">muglichkeit</unclear>, dienstlicher <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">orten</unclear>
<lb n="15"/>für unnd angewendet. Darüber wir dann
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nochmalen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ungezweifelter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hoffnung</unclear>, der würck=
<lb n="17"/>liche <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erfolg</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">disere</unclear> unnsere <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bemuochung</unclear> und
<lb n="18"/>gelegenheit, inn kurtzem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bescheinen</unclear> werde.
<lb n="19"/>Wie wir nun unns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jederzeithe</unclear>, der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Erbeinung</unclear>
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">steiffen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">observantz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beflissen</unclear>, ouch mit fuog kein
<lb n="21"/>widriges beÿzemessen, also sein wir fürohin
<lb n="22"/>nit weniger zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohnfellbarlicher</unclear> obacht beharr=
<lb n="23"/>lich geneigt. Soellen dabeÿ aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> nicht
<lb n="24"/>verhalten, wir erst <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diser</unclear> tagen, durch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gloüb=</unclear>
<lb n="25"/>würdige <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">avisen</unclear> berichtet, wie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unbekandtes</unclear> kriegs=
<lb n="26"/>volckh, durch theils eüwer gebiets: unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obrig=</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2518_9710.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">leüten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">passirt</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">durchgezogen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Steig</unclear>
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bemächtiget</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">heben</unclear>, unnd witter <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jnen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuoß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zesezen</unclear>,
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unserem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">land</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">by</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beysendtiger</unclear> willens
<lb n="30"/>sin sollen. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Dieweil</unclear> aber da solliches
<lb n="31"/>nit mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüweren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wüßen</unclear> willen unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuothuon</unclear>
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beschehen</unclear>, oder <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bemelter</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dritzehen</unclear> theils <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuege=</unclear>
<lb n="33"/>want <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sin</unclear> soll. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">angeregte</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Erbeinigung</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eüwere</unclear>
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Abscheiden</unclear>, schrifft: und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mündtlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vertröst</unclear>:
<lb n="35"/>und versprechungen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-24" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lindawischen</unclear></placeName> ver=
<lb n="36"/>gleich, bey wellichem wir allein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unseres</unclear> huß=
<lb n="37"/>es recht: und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gerechtigkeiten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zueerhalten</unclear>,
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">niemanden</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weder</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <orgName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Cron</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Franckreich</unclear></orgName>
<lb n="39"/>an dero <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">habenden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">püntnußen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">noch</unclear> den Pünt=
<lb n="40"/>en an Jrem Juri belli <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erobreten</unclear> landen, uff
<lb n="41"/>eüwer <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jngerente</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bewerliche</unclear> Interposition,
<lb n="42"/>wie wir wol <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">befüegt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gewest</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Endtziehen</unclear>
<lb n="43"/>begehrt. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">redt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sagen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hebt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jr</unclear> unbeschwert <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zue=</unclear>
<lb n="44"/>erachten, wir nicht <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unbillig</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deßertwegen</unclear>
<lb n="45"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allerhandt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">empfindtliche</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gedanckhen</unclear>,
<lb n="46"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schöpffen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getrenget</unclear>. Weil <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">danuß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear>
<lb n="47"/>sowohl als <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andern</unclear> benachparten, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sicht</unclear> ge=
<lb n="48"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ringe</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gefahren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zueerwachßen</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">endtstehen</unclear>
<lb n="49"/>künden, werdet Jr zeits eben selbigen beyfall nit
<lb n="50"/>geben, sondern unß gegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">versehen</unclear> wollen,
<lb n="51"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jr</unclear> an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüwerem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohrt</unclear>, nichts <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gestatten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werdet</unclear>,
<lb n="52"/>der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Erbeinigung</unclear> und nachparlichen Correspondents
<lb n="53"/>zuewider: oder den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frieden</unclear> was betrüeben solte.
<lb n="54"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eüch</unclear> demnach gnedig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersuchende</unclear>, Jr zu <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">würck=</unclear>
<lb n="55"/>licher haltung, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mehrermelter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Erbeinigung</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2518_9711.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="56"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wollstendigen</unclear> nachbarschafft. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">euch</unclear>
<lb n="57"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bewußter</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abscheiden</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">euch</unclear> angelegen sin <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lasse</unclear>-
<lb n="58"/>en <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wollet</unclear>. Die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüernige</unclear> so sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">villeicht</unclear>
<lb n="59"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beÿ</unclear> obgemeltem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kriegsvolckh</unclear> befinden.
<lb n="60"/>Allßbald der orten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abzuforderen</unclear>, oder <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geg</unclear>-
<lb n="61"/>en den jenigen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">welliche</unclear> solliches an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jrer</unclear>
<lb n="62"/>Direction oder Comando haben, durch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">euwre</unclear>
<lb n="63"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vertrauwliche</unclear> Interposition <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuuermellten</unclear>
<lb n="64"/>damit die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abfüerung</unclear> fürderlich fürgenomen
<lb n="65"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßere</unclear> der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">enden</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anrüerende</unclear> landt
<lb n="66"/>und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">leüt</unclear>, nicht <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">betrangt</unclear>, noch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anderen</unclear>
<lb n="67"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glosieren</unclear>. oder <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weiterung</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anlaß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erweckt</unclear>
<lb n="68"/>werde. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jnmaßen</unclear> wir der billichen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">willfar</unclear>
<lb n="69"/>kein zweifell, und euwre andtworthlichen
<lb n="70"/>erklerung ehist erwarten. Denen wir
<lb n="71"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beneben</unclear> mit gnedigsten und nachbarlichen
<lb n="72"/>willen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wollbeigethon</unclear> verbleiben. Geben
<lb n="73"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> <origPlace ref="stadtasg-places-448" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Breisach</unclear></origPlace> <origDate when="1624" resp="#ner">den 5ten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">9b</unclear>. Anno <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">1624</unclear></origDate>.
<lb n="74"/><persName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Leopold</persName>.
<lb n="75"/>Ad mandatum <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ser.mi</unclear> Domni:
<lb n="76"/>Archiducis proprium
<lb n="77"/><persName role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Joh</unclear>: <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Balth</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Tischlerzoll</unclear></persName>.
<lb n="78"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">An</unclear> <orgName role="recipient" resp="#ner">burgermeister. Schultheiß. landt-
<lb n="79"/>aman und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">räthe</unclear>. der. 13. orten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lobl</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eÿdtge</unclear>.</orgName>
